{"id":"en_he-killed-our-baby-and-lost-me-forever","title":"He Killed Our Baby and Lost Me Forever","titleEn":"He Killed Our Baby and Lost Me Forever","description":"Nora Bennett, a brilliant architect, has spent five years married to Adrian Sterling, a tech CEO, under the impression that he merely isn't ready to become a father. That illusion shatters when a recalled baptism invitation reveals Adrian already has a son with influencer Sienna Blake. Nora also discovers she is six weeks pregnant. During her birthday celebration, Adrian pushes her into broken glass to keep his secret son hidden, and she loses the baby. She files for divorce, but Sienna abducts her and throws her off a cliff before she can leave. Though everyone assumes Nora is dead, six months later Adrian spots a woman he recognizes walking onto the stage at an international architecture awards ceremony.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/he-killed-our-baby-and-lost-me-forever/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/he-killed-our-baby-and-lost-me-forever/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du3hc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_he-killed-our-baby-and-lost-me-forever_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du3hc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_he-killed-our-baby-and-lost-me-forever_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du3hc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_he-killed-our-baby-and-lost-me-forever_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"http